213 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 214 0 R/Alt(Six shaded renderings of the same box-shaped frame of square aluminum tubes, seen from above and one corner. Panel a, the article alone: gray tubes forming top and bottom frames joined by corner posts, three dark gray steel blocks for the lumped masses, three short tubes carrying small blocks at their ends for the components, an orange mass on two thin red strips at one top corner for the hardening member, yellow triangles at the three component tips and the member, and open black squares at the four bottom corners for the mount points. Panels b to f show the same article hanging on thin cords with dark blue cylindrical shaker bodies, each with a black arrow pointing into the frame along its force direction, filled blue circles for control gauge points, open orange diamonds for the four held-out gauge points, which sit at the same places in every panel, and the yellow tip triangles. Panel b, 3 shakers and 12 control gauges. Panel c, 6 shakers on the same 12 control gauges, the first three shakers those of b. Panel d, 12 shakers and 24 control gauges spread over the frame. Panel e, 6 shakers and 6 control gauges, with the shakers in different places from panel c. Panel f, 12 shakers on the same 12 control gauges as b and c, the first six shakers those of c. A legend below the panels names each symbol.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[1]/Pg 1240 0 R>>
endobj
