434 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 435 0 R/Alt(Four scatter plots of stress error in decibels, from about 2 to 20, against control-gauge error in decibels. In panel a, the default law on the same 12 control gauges: green open downward triangles for 3 shakers sit at control errors of 7 to 10 dB and stress errors of 3 to 8 dB; blue open circles for 6 shakers sit to their left, at control errors near 5 to 7 dB and stress errors of 2 to 5.5 dB; orange filled squares for 12 shakers sit further left at control errors of 3 to 6.5 dB but high, at stress errors of 4.5 to 18 dB. Gray lines join each structure's three points, running left and down from 3 to 6 shakers and then left and sharply up to 12. Panel b, the band-average law on the same gauges: the three groups step left and slightly down, from 6 to 8 dB of control error at 3 shakers to about 1.5 to 3 dB at 12, all with stress errors between about 1.7 and 6 dB. Panel c, the default law, 6 shakers on 12 control gauges as blue open circles at control errors of 5 to 7 dB and stress errors of 2 to 5.5 dB, joined to pink filled diamonds for 6 shakers on 6 control gauges at control errors of 2 to 4.5 dB and stress errors of 5 to 19.5 dB. Panel d, the band-average law: the pink diamonds sit at 1.5 to 3.3 dB of control error and 2 to 5.3 dB of stress error, beside the blue circles at 3 to 5.5 dB and 2 to 4.6 dB.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1245 0 R>>
endobj
