589 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 590 0 R/Alt(Four scatter plots. Top left, as many shakers as control gauges: stress error from about 2 to 23 dB against control-gauge error from about 1 to 8 dB, blue filled circles for 6 shakers on 6 gauges and orange open triangles for 12 on 12; the points fill the plot with no clear trend, and runs with stress errors above 15 dB sit at control errors from 2.5 to 7 dB. Top right, the same runs against held-out-gauge error from about 3.5 to 17 dB: the points rise along a band from about 2 dB of stress at 4 dB held-out to about 20 dB at 16 dB held-out. Bottom left and right, more control gauges than shakers, on log axes: green open downward triangles for 3 shakers on 12, pink open squares for 6 on 12 and yellow filled diamonds for 12 on 24. Both plots show a rising cloud from about 2 dB of stress at 3 dB of gauge error to about 8 dB at 10 dB, and a separate group of green triangles at gauge errors of 20 to 30 dB and stress errors of 14 to 30 dB.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1249 0 R>>
endobj
